<title>POLAND: Raiffeisen in $20 mln Polish shipyard loan.</title>
<headline>Raiffeisen in $20 mln Polish shipyard loan.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish unit of Austria's Raiffeisen Zentralbank Osterreich AG, Raiffeisen Centrobank SA, has signed a contract for it and its parent to lend the Szczecin shipyard $19.8 million, the Polish unit said.</p>
<p>The Tuesday statement said each bank would provide half the credit for the building of a container ship for a German firm with the Polish unit serving as the loan's agent.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
